msgctxt "DeviceTab|"
msgid ""
"Below you can set which device Stopmotion should use for grabbing images and "
"displaying video."
msgstr ""
"Behean, Stopmotion-ek irudiak harrapatzeko eta bideoa azaltzeko zer gailu "
"erabili behar duen ezar dezakezu."

#: src/presentation/frontends/qtfrontend/devicetab.cpp:56
#: src/presentation/frontends/qtfrontend/devicetab.cpp:343
msgctxt "DeviceTab|"
msgid ""
"You can select from the auto-detected devices below or add devices yourself. "
"It is not recommended to use devices which is not auto-detected, but feel "
"free to do it if you are an advanced user."
msgstr ""
"Behean automatikoki antzemandako gailuen artetik aukera dezakezu, edo "
"gailuak zuk zeuk gehi ditzakezu. Ez da gomendatzen automatikoki antzeman ez "
"den gailurik erabiltzea, baina lasai egin ezazu erabiltzaile aurreratua "
"bazara."

